    goodPt, serre, ext, cext, lemB, GlobalTheory.EvVal.evValSt, vv, g, pbc, quot, GlobalTheory.unramExt_law⟩,
    ⟨sbcAny, stw, charPair, GlobalTheory.smoothDense⟩⟩

